{"chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1","number":2,"title":"Raum & Zeit präzise ausdrücken","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Ich brauche deine Antwort unmittelbar nach der Sitzung","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Gut Im Laufe der Woche sende ich dir den Bericht","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Perfekt Können wir das gleichzeitig mit der Präsentation bearbeiten","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Ja In unmittelbarer Nähe des Termins planen wir das Meeting","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Im Rahmen des Projekts sollten wir auch das Budget besprechen","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Einverstanden Dann sehen wir uns morgen","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"unmittelbar","voiceRole":"female","pos":"Adjective/Adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"unmittelbar","voiceRole":"male","pos":"Adjective/Adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"gleichzeitig","voiceRole":"female","pos":"Adjective/Adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"gleichzeitig","voiceRole":"male","pos":"Adjective/Adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"im Laufe","voiceRole":"female","pos":"Präposition (fixed expression)","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"im Laufe","voiceRole":"male","pos":"Präposition (fixed expression)","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"in unmittelbarer Nähe","voiceRole":"female","pos":"Präpositionalphrase","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"in unmittelbarer Nähe","voiceRole":"male","pos":"Präpositionalphrase","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"im Rahmen","voiceRole":"female","pos":"Präposition (fixed expression, abstract)","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"im Rahmen","voiceRole":"male","pos":"Präposition (fixed expression, abstract)","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Wer heute durch die Speicherstadt in Hamburg spaziert sieht kaum noch etwas von ihrer ursprünglichen Bestimmung als Lagerhausviertel Bis in die 1980er Jahre hinein lagerten hier Kaffee Tee und Gewürze aus aller Welt Im Laufe der neunziger Jahre jedoch verlor der Hafen zunehmend an Bedeutung für den klassischen Warenumschlag und die Stadt stand vor der Frage was mit den backsteinroten Speichern geschehen sollte Zwischen 2003 und 2009 entstand daraufhin direkt angrenzend die HafenCity eines der größten Stadtentwicklungsprojekte Europas Heute gut zwei Jahrzehnte später leben und arbeiten dort mehrere Zehntausend Menschen wo einst nur Kräne standen","authoredText":"Wer heute durch die Speicherstadt in Hamburg spaziert, sieht kaum noch etwas von ihrer ursprünglichen Bestimmung als Lagerhausviertel. Bis in die 1980er Jahre hinein lagerten hier Kaffee, Tee und Gewürze aus aller Welt. Im Laufe der neunziger Jahre jedoch verlor der Hafen zunehmend an Bedeutung für den klassischen Warenumschlag, und die Stadt stand vor der Frage, was mit den backsteinroten Speichern geschehen sollte. Zwischen 2003 und 2009 entstand daraufhin direkt angrenzend die HafenCity – eines der größten Stadtentwicklungsprojekte Europas. Heute, gut zwei Jahrzehnte später, leben und arbeiten dort mehrere Zehntausend Menschen, wo einst nur Kräne standen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Stadtmagazin: Vom Speicher zum Stadtviertel","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, wann genau triffst du am Bahnhof ein?","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_002_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ich muss es meinem Kollegen mitteilen.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_002_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Voraussichtlich gegen halb drei, direkt gegenüber dem Haupteingang.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_002_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Perfekt, dann sage ich ihm, er soll sich innerhalb der nächsten zwanzig Minuten dorthin begeben.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_002_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Gut, und falls sich etwas verzögert, melde ich mich sofort.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_002_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, wann genau triffst du am Bahnhof ein? Ich muss es meinem Kollegen mitteilen.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_002_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Voraussichtlich gegen halb drei, direkt gegenüber dem Haupteingang.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_002_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-02-raum-und-zeit-praezise-ausdruecken","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Perfekt, dann sage ich ihm, er soll sich innerhalb de